			<h2 class="comments-title">
			2 thoughts on &ldquo;Cool Flames on the International Space Station &#8211; An Anatomy of Discovery&rdquo;		</h2>

		
		<ol class="comment-list">
					<li id="comment-416" class="comment even thread-even depth-1">
			<article id="div-comment-416" class="comment-body">
				<footer class="comment-meta">
					<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<img alt='' src='https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/48ba23b1d4aac2d90866d4c113eeaaea?s=42&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g' srcset='https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/48ba23b1d4aac2d90866d4c113eeaaea?s=84&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-42 photo' height='42' width='42' loading='lazy' decoding='async'/>						<b class="fn">evab</b> <span class="says">says:</span>					</div><!-- .comment-author -->

					<div class="comment-metadata">
						<a href="https://blogs.nasa.gov/ISS_Science_Blog/2013/11/25/cool-flames-on-the-international-space-station-an-anatomy-of-discovery/#comment-416"><time datetime="2013-12-02T19:21:07+00:00">December 2, 2013 at 7:21 pm</time></a>					</div><!-- .comment-metadata -->

